Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/techbysaurabh/meetinginsights-linux

Package: meetinginsights
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.9), python3-venv, python3-gi,
 gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.0, gir1.2-notify-0.7,
 pulseaudio-utils, ffmpeg, curl
Description: Record meetings and write notes, entirely on device
 MeetingInsights records a meeting from the microphone and system audio, transcribes
 it locally with faster-whisper and writes structured notes with a small local
 language model. No account, no API key and no audio ever leaves the machine.
 .
 Speaker attribution comes from audio routing rather than a diarization model:
 the microphone is recorded to the left channel and system audio to the right.
